    "description": {
      "value": "<p><b>Marauder · уровень 3</b></p><p>You can take a Bonus Action to make an Unarmed Strike using the Shove option. If you have a Shield equipped or the creature has the Prone condition, it has Disadvantage on the saving throw.<br>If you shove a creature and push it, you can push it 10 feet instead of 5 feet, and move with the creature horizontally without provoking Opportunity Attacks, remaining within 5 feet of it at the end of your movement.</p><hr><p><b>Автоматизация / ограничения:</b></p><ul><li>Цель выбирает Str/Dex. Помеха от щита/Prone, выбор отталкивания или Prone и перемещение — вручную.</li></ul>"
